OL,3,GNEWSAParalympian charged with 11 counts
OL,4,Aof rape                                
OL,6,FHe appeared at Leeds Crown Court on    
OL,7,FThursday, where he pleaded not guilty  
OL,8,Fto all the charges except voyeurism,   
OL,9,Ffor which no plea was entered. He is   
OL,10,Fdue to stand trial on 22 March next    
OL,11,Fyear.                                  
OL,13,FBritish Wheelchair Basketball (BWB)    
OL,14,Fconfirmed he had been removed from the 
OL,15,FGB programme and all British Wheelchair
OL,16,FBasketball activities when he was      
OL,17,Farrested in July.                      
